  "notes": "Silent video with no text: all amounts, the number of whistles and the cooking time are my estimates, so check the pressure-cook time yourself (drumsticks should be soft). Salt looked pink (maybe rock salt). The yellow shaker is hing (looks like a hing tin). Ghee looked like solid ghee (could be butter). The pulp left in the sieve is thrown away. The cooking water is poured through the sieve, then the soup is cooked with the tadka. Very low protein (about 3 g per serving)."
